WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.720
Everyone in the world is good

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.840
till they get a chance to betray

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.720
For love

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.680
For power

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:11.920
For war

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.240
For victory

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.320
Eras may change, reasons may differ

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.160
but betrayal never changes

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.320
Betrayal always comes disguised

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.760
Wearing a mask

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.120
Spotting an enemy is easy, 

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.000
but a friend pretending to be an enemy?

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.040
Betrayal never begins with the truth, 

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.000
it begins with a cute lie

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.200
Friend or Girlfriend?

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.200
Come Closer

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.280
Betray one person? It’s a crime

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.720
Betray everyone?

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.560
 It’s a Game!

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.640
Here, suspicion isn’t your enemy, 

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:16.280
it’s your best friend

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.440
One thing is for certain in this game,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.760
Everyone betrays and everyone gets betrayed

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.760
Trust is uncool

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.320
Betrayal is the new rule

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:45.920
Watch!

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.600
The Traitors

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:47.920
Only on Prime video

